  "blocks": [
    {
      "id": "b0001",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "8a31874119b8ae4d",
      "translationZh": "首先，它们产生的 token 真的更少吗？",
      "provider": "openrouter",
      "model": "google/gemma-4-26b-a4b-it:free"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0002",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "a4d2eb2fe2337b94",
      "translationZh": "是的。每次基准测试运行的总 token 数（4 种场景）：基础量化版约为 66k，ThinkingCap 约为 49k（减少 26%），Swift 约为 45k（减少 33%）。因此，“减少思考”是真实存在的——而且 Swift 的削减幅度最大。",
      "provider": "openrouter",
      "model": "google/gemma-4-26b-a4b-it:free"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0003",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "409c45cd99cf21f0",
      "translationZh": "而这正是变得有趣的地方。这两种量化方式的权衡方式并不相同：",
      "provider": "openrouter",
      "model": "google/gemma-4-26b-a4b-it:free"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0004",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "0b88be156a817603",
      "translationZh": "解码阶段：基础版约为 48 t/s。ThinkingCap 几乎没有变化（约为 43）。Swift 大幅下降（约为 32，下降 33%）。",
      "provider": "openrouter",
      "model": "google/gemma-4-26b-a4b-it:free"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0005",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "6318061adbb903e3",
      "translationZh": "预填充 / TTFT —— 与我的预期相反：Swift 最快（约为 614 t/s，TTFT 约为 1s），基础版居中（约为 530 t/s，约为 1.2s），ThinkingCap 最慢（约为 100 t/s，TTFT 6–11s）。",
      "provider": "openrouter",
      "model": "google/gemma-4-26b-a4b-it:free"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0006",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "d09b809f4fd1b6f6",
      "translationZh": "质量保持：在我的评估中约为 84–87，与基础版处于同一区间。",
      "provider": "openrouter",
      "model": "google/gemma-4-26b-a4b-it:free"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0007",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "3e553e0c37f294a4",
      "translationZh": "ThinkingCap 的完成速度比基础版快约 23%。即使预填充速度较慢，token 的节省也带来了优势。Swift 由于解码速度较慢，表现为盈亏平衡。",
      "provider": "openrouter",
      "model": "google/gemma-4-26b-a4b-it:free"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0008",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "3284f4528b37b031",
      "translationZh": "量化 预填充 解码 质量 运行时间",
      "provider": "openrouter",
      "model": "google/gemma-4-26b-a4b-it:free"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0009",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "7fdd7c7406819a41",
      "translationZh": "注意事项：每个量化版本仅运行了 2 次，因此单次运行的方差会影响这些结果。ThinkingCap 的预填充速度异常低。需要对此进行更多测试。",
      "provider": "openrouter",
      "model": "google/gemma-4-26b-a4b-it:free"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0010",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "fe1c5aec9beb1ef3",
      "translationZh": "以下是 3 次运行的并排对比（思考模式 xhigh，Q4_K_M，全部使用 7900 XTX）：",
      "provider": "openrouter",
      "model": "google/gemma-4-26b-a4b-it:free"
    },
    {
